Third-party content:

- Thermodynamic databases in `data/databases/` are TU Wien MatCalc open
  databases (ODbL 1.0) and COST 507 — see `data/databases/registry.json` for
  per-file source, citation and license.
- Micrographs in `public/references/` are Wikimedia Commons images under
  per-image Public Domain / CC0 / CC BY / CC BY-SA licenses — see
  `data/references/catalog.json` for per-image attribution.
